# About Me
ABOUT_TITLE=About Me
ABOUT_PARAGRAPH=Senior Software Engineer, Angular-first, with five years on enterprise platforms in banking, government and retail. My recurring brief is modernisation: taking legacy AngularJS and ASPX systems into current Angular while the business keeps running — most recently a large-scale eBanking platform, and the EuroElections 2024 voting system from Angular 7 to 18. Comfortable across the stack — .NET BFF, Node.js, REST APIs, SQL — and shipping it through Azure DevOps, Jenkins and Docker. Team leader at Cognity; React / Next.js and AI-assisted delivery on my own client work.


